Pokémon Emerald 3Ds Dual Screen changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: French berry name order
Applies after 0031-spanish-berry-and-rival-labels.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

The French ROM prints the berry as "BAIE ORAN" (word first), like the Spanish one;
src/item.c's English order would print "ORAN BAIE".
diff --git a/src/item.c b/src/item.c
--- a/src/item.c
+++ b/src/item.c
@@ -109,7 +109,7 @@
     else
         berryString = gText_Berries;
 
-#if defined(PORT_BRIDGE) && GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_SPANISH
+#if defined(PORT_BRIDGE) && (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_SPANISH || GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_FRENCH)
     txtPtr = StringCopy(dst, berryString);
     *txtPtr = CHAR_SPACE;
     StringCopy(txtPtr + 1, berryName);
